<title>UK: Foreningsbanken sets $150 mln 5-yr FRN.</title>
<headline>Foreningsbanken sets $150 mln 5-yr FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Chase and Lehman Brothers.</p>
<p> BORROWER   FORENINGSBANKEN AB</p>
<p> AMT    $150 MLN	BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY    14.FEB.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +6.25 BP  PAY DATE    14.FEB.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY A3	  ISS PRICE  99.855    FULL FEES   17.5 BP</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   =	   REOFFER    99.855</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K) 100+10    SALE LIMITS US/UK/SE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    7.5 BP    SELL CONC  10 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF THE EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
